Unity Examples – Access to Variables, Methods, Game Objects and ScriptsYou can also expose references to other objects to the inspector. Below you can drag a game object that contains the OtherScript on the target slot in the inspector.
using UnityEngine;
using System.Collections;
 
public class example : MonoBehaviour {
	public OtherScript target;

	void Update() {
		target.foo = 2;
		target.DoSomething("Hello");
	}
}
